cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This file describes the bounded GCN_GRAPH reproduction. Cite the original
  MoleculeACE article and both corrections when describing the benchmark.
title: GCN reproduction of the corrected MoleculeACE benchmark
type: software
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - given-names: Cristina
    family-names: Correa Segade
repository-code: https://github.com/CrisCorreaS/MoleculeACE_GCN_Implementation
abstract: >-
  A bounded reproduction of GCN_GRAPH using corrected MoleculeACE benchmark
  data and published configurations for 30 datasets and five internal folds.
  Other published methods appear only as reference results; no additional
  model strategies or hyperparameter searches are implemented.
